---@class posthog.alerts.CreateAlertsSimulateRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field evaluation_delay_intervals? number Skip this many completed insight intervals before simulation, matching live evaluation. Time-series Trends only; a positive delay requires check_ongoing_interval=false.
